BROWSER WORKSPACE

The browser workspace, the settings layer, and the UltraRAG gateway are this
project's own code:

    src/research_rag/surfaces/workspace/
    src/research_rag/settings_layers/
    src/research_rag/gateway/

The workspace, the settings layer, and the gateway were each developed in an
earlier repository of the same author and were part of this codebase from the
start, so this project resolves no dependency on another of that author's
projects. None of them carries UltraRAG source: the gateway installs a pinned,
clone-free UltraRAG snapshot at run time and proxies its stages over MCP.

PROVENANCE

This repository was created from `research-ultra-rag-mcp-server`, an independent
MCP server over the same engine. That server is archived and still installed on
the machines that carry it, and both read and write the same projects. The
on-disk state format is byte-compatible, so both may serve one project.

    research-ultra-rag-mcp-server
    seed commit 0f5da3d611ae12b9807bae93c7f270b7d303b35f
    https://github.com/AhmedKishki/research-ultra-rag-mcp-server

The retrieval, extraction, generation, and storage code is that project's. The
changes are the product surface, the command names, the launcher and settings
names described in `AGENTS.md`, and the documents. The upstream project's own
history remains there.

